5. PACKAGE PINNING RATIONALE (WHY THESE VERSIONS ARE PREFERRED)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* PyTorch 2.1.2+cu121: Provides stable CUDA 12.x allocator memory pooling and
  fixes known memory leak regressions in non-reentrant activation checkpointing.
* BitsAndBytes 0.42.0: Essential for stable 4-bit NormalFloat (NF4) dequantization
  and `paged_adamw_8bit` host RAM paging on 16GB consumer/cloud cards.
* Transformers 4.38.2 & TRL 0.7.11: Prevents breaking changes in `DPOTrainer`
  keyword argument schemas (`max_prompt_length` removal in trl 0.29+) while
  maintaining exact chat template formatting for Qwen 2.5 tokenizers.

